  "question": {
    "text": "If the work functions of three photosensitive materials are <math><mn>1</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>eV</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>2&nbsp;</mn><mi>eV</mi></math> and <math><mn>3</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>eV</mi></math> respectively, then the ratio of the respective frequencies of light that produce photoelectrons of the maximum kinetic energy of <math><mn>1&nbsp;</mn><mi>eV</mi></math> from each of them is",
